るものと心より感謝申し上げます。つきましては、株主の皆さまへの感謝の意を表すため、2026年３月期の期末配当金を前回予想の１株当たり14円から１円増配して１株当たり15円に修正することといたしました。この結果、 年間配当金は27円となる予定であります。今後も、財務健全性を確保しつつ、資本効率の向上を図り、安定的な配当の継続に努めてまいります。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["PreviousReportingDate", "PreviousReportingDate", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", null, "2026年2月10日", null, "CurrentYearInstant"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 14, "14.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 26, "26.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 15, "15.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 27, "27.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "当期", 12, "12.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 20, "20.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 28, "28.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 48, "48.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["NoteToDividends", "NoteToDividends", "tse-ed-t", "当期", null, "当社は、2025年４月１日付で普通株式１株につき２株の割合で株式分割を行っており、前期2025年３月期については当該株式分割前の実際の配当金の額を記載しております。なお、株式分割を考慮しない場合の当期2026年３月期の年間配当金は、１株当たり54円00銭となります。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["FiscalYearEnd", "FiscalYearEnd", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", null, "2026-03-31", null, "CurrentYearInsta